        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1728",
          "body_paragraph": 1,
          "quote": "Many thanks for the 7 days old White Dorking & for the other promised ones.— I am getting quite “a chamber of horrors”. I appreciate your kindness even more than before; for I have done the black deed & murdered an angel",
